Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}In March, the council in Muhos voted yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.85,0:00:03.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}Outside, it rained. One resident appealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}In September, Doodle promised thirteen billion euros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:06.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}Part of it for local biodiversity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.05,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}Then the forest at Muhos came down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.55,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}About 330 hectares, by the company’s own count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}The biodiversity was stacked neatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:12.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}Above 200 hectares, the law asks for an assessment first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}On the seventh of October, the regulator said stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:15.95,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}Until the impact assessment is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:17.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}About a hundred came to Doodle’s door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.15,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,260)}Fifty thousand signed an initiative to parliament.
